      "tags": ["Thai", "Noodles", "Quick & Easy"],
      "instructions": "1. Whisk together oyster sauce, light soy sauce, dark soy sauce, white vinegar, and sugar in a small bowl.\n2. Heat oil in a wok or large skillet over very high heat.\n3. Add garlic and chicken; stir fry until chicken is mostly cooked.\n4. Add Chinese broccoli stems and cook for 1 minute.\n5. Push ingredients to the side, crack the egg into the pan, and scramble.\n6. Add fresh wide rice noodles, leafy greens, and the sauce. Toss vigorously until noodles are caramelized and cooked through.",
